oneOf.description:
Conversations from a deployed agent and the checks run on them. Absent: off, and the server refuses the agent's conversations;
present (even empty, `monitoring: {}`): on, with these settings. Switching it on is the agent's repository agreeing that its
conversations are stored.

CheckInputEventCheck.description:
An event the agent emitted: by default at least one whose data contains JsonElement? EventCheck.Data. With a bound it counts those events;
with bool? EventCheck.Last it compares only the last event of the type. The optional members are left out when not set, so a
check written before them keeps its content hash.
